'''Xàbia''' ({{IPA|ca|ˈʃabia}}), spelled '''Xabiga''' in [[Baliscano]], is an urban [[Communes of Balisca|commune]] within the [[Canyars]] region of [[Estuaria]] (a [[Communities of Balisca|community]] of [[Balisca]]), and its historic capital. With a metropolitan population of 1.7 million people, Xàbia is the 18th-most populous metropolitan area in Balisca. As of June 2025, it is ranked as a [[Adonia Globalization and World Cities Ranks|Beta- global city]]. 

